   "order": 1,
   "title_en": "Bambu 3D Effect Plate",
   "body_en": "Need some extra pizazz for your prints? Bambu 3D Effect Plate can transfer interesting surface textures to your printed objects. There are 4 exciting textures, ranging from Carbon Fiber all the way to Starry, Galaxy, and Diamond! Want to make your prints stand out? Get Bambu 3D Effect Plate and unlock a world of textural possibilities!",
