   "order": 3,
   "title_en": "Galaxy Surface",
   "body_en": "The Galaxy Surface transfers a vibrant galaxy rainbow effect on the first layer of the print, which glitters and changes color depending on the angle. It works best with silk or shiny filaments to take advantage of the pattern transfer.",
